  "_comment": "This fragment declares no object types of its own and no top-level `relations` key: every access tier the module needs (admin/submitter/approver) already exists on the platform base model's `company_module` type (internal/authz/engine/model.json) and is referenced only, never redeclared. `timesheet.entries.manage-own` is company-membership-gated only (the ordered decision's steps 1-6), the same shape notification's `inbox.view` uses for its no-relation-leg tier (company_module has no `member` relation to anchor on). Submitter/approver designation (which member holds `company_module#submitter`/`#approver`) is written through the existing /internal/authz/grants surface by this module's own approvers API, never a parallel grant store; the module keeps only a read-side list cache because authz has a grant/revoke API but no list-by-object-relation query."
